<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Aachal Wani | Portfolio & Digital Resume</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0f172a;
            --card-bg: #1e293b;
            --accent-color: #fb7185;
            --accent-gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #f43f5e 0%, #fb7185 100%);
            --text-main: #f8fafc;
            --text-muted: #94a3b8;
            --border-color: #334155;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            line-height: 1.7;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        /* Hero Header */
        header {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        .tag {
            display: inline-block;
            background: rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.1);
            color: var(--accent-color);
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 2.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, #cbd5e1 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .contact-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-top: 15px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .contact-links a {
            color: var(--accent-color);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: opacity 0.2s;
        }

        .contact-links a:hover {
            opacity: 0.8;
        }

        /* Section Styling */
        section {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            padding: 35px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            color: var(--accent-color);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        h2::after {
            content: '';
            flex: 1;
            height: 1px;
            background: var(--border-color);
        }

        p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        /* Tables & Lists */
        .table-responsive {
            overflow-x: auto;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-top: 10px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        th {
            background: #0f172a;
            color: var(--text-main);
            padding: 12px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        td {
            padding: 14px 12px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        ul {
            list-style: none;
        }

        li {
            position: relative;
            padding-left: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        li::before {
            content: '✦';
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            color: var(--accent-color);
        }

        li strong {
            color: var(--text-main);
        }

        /* Grid for Skills */
        .skills-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .skill-card {
            background: #0f172a;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        .skill-card h3 {
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-size: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .skill-card p {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <!-- Hero Header -->
        <header>
            <span class="tag">Marketing & Content Creator</span>
            <h1>AACHAL WANI</h1>
            <p>Driven Marketing Professional and Brand Content Creator specializing in the Food & Beverage (F&B) and Hospitality sectors. Combines data-driven market research, consumer behavior insights, and compelling digital storytelling to execute high-impact promotional campaigns.</p>
            <div class="contact-links">
                <span>✉️ achalwani04@gmail.com</span>
                <span>📍 Pune, Maharashtra</span>
                <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/AachalWani" target="_blank">🔗 linkedin.com/in/AachalWani</a>
            </div>
        </header>

        <!-- Career Profile -->
        <section>
            <h2>Career Profile</h2>
            <p>Proven track record of strategic brand collaborations that boost consumer engagement and brand visibility.</p>
        </section>

        <!-- Education -->
        <section>
            <h2>Education</h2>
            <div class="table-responsive">
                <table>
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th>Qualification</th>
                            <th>Institution</th>
                            <th>Board / University</th>
                            <th>Year</th>
                            <th>Score / CGPA</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td><strong>BBA (Marketing)</strong></td>
                            <td>Brihan Maharashtra College of Commerce (BMCC)</td>
                            <td>Savitribai Phule Pune University</td>
                            <td>2022 – 2025</td>
                            <td>7.73 CGPA</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><strong>HSC (Class XII)</strong></td>
                            <td>Swami Vivekanand College, Washim</td>
                            <td>Maharashtra State Board</td>
                            <td>2022</td>
                            <td>93.50%</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><strong>CBSE (Class X)</strong></td>
                            <td>Happy Faces The Concept School, Washim</td>
                            <td>CBSE Board</td>
                            <td>2020</td>
                            <td>88.00%</td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Brand Collaborations & Projects -->
        <section>
            <h2>Brand Collaborations & Marketing Projects</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>
                    <strong>Content Creator & Brand Collaborator — F&B, Hospitality & Lifestyle (2023 – Present):</strong>
                    <br>
                    <strong>Strategic Brand Partnerships:</strong> Conceptualized and produced engaging visual content in collaboration with prominent premium hospitality and retail brands, including Hyatt, Sheraton Grand, Bastian Hospitality, Broadway, and IKEA.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Audience Engagement & Growth:</strong> Translated consumer preference insights into high-performing short-form video campaigns, boosting digital touchpoints and brand interaction metrics across targeted demographics.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>End-to-End Campaign Strategy:</strong> Managed full campaign lifecycles from initial outreach, visual storytelling, and content scripting to final delivery and performance tracking.
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- Positions of Responsibility -->
        <section>
            <h2>Positions of Responsibility & Leadership</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>
                    <strong>Event Coordinator & Volunteer — 'Troika' Annual College Fest:</strong> Successfully managed event operations and co-led the Quiz Competition execution, directing logistics for over 200+ participants.
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- Key Achievements -->
        <section>
            <h2>Key Achievements</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>
                    <strong>Sports Excellence:</strong> Represented district in competitive Badminton at the District Level, demonstrating strong discipline, focus, and endurance under high-pressure competitive environments.
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- Skills & Competencies -->
        <section>
            <h2>Skills & Competencies</h2>
            <div class="skills-grid">
                <div class="skill-card">
                    <h3>Functional Skills</h3>
                    <p>Brand Strategy & Marketing, Digital Content Creation, Consumer Insights, F&B Campaign Management, Market Research</p>
                </div>
                <div class="skill-card">
                    <h3>Technical / Digital</h3>
                    <p>MS Office (Excel, Word, PowerPoint), Canva, Social Media Analytics, Visual Editing Tools</p>
                </div>
                <div class="skill-card">
                    <h3>Behavioural Skills</h3>
                    <p>Cross-functional Teamwork, Strategic Problem Solving, Time Management, Creative Communication</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Certifications -->
        <section>
            <h2>Certifications</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Tally Accounting & Financial Management Certification</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- Languages -->
        <section>
            <h2>Languages</h2>
            <p><strong>English, Hindi, Marathi</strong> (Fluent) | <strong>French</strong> (Basic)</p>
        </section>

        <footer>
            <p>© 2026 Aachal Wani | Hosted on Vercel</p>
        </footer>
    </div>
</body>
</html>